# 30 September 2026 : the HDA interface of the ceramic green material. At most 8 parameters per category (Pattern, Colour, Render), the most important ones first; everything else stays inside the graph.
# The parameters live as spare parameters on the Copernicus network node /obj/CeramicGreen_Height; every wrangle reads them with chf("/obj/CeramicGreen_Height/<name>"), so a change is made in ONE place and
# propagates everywhere (HDA rule of ~/.claude/rules/ParametricHda1.md). Defaults reproduce the current measured result exactly. Rebuilding the graph keeps the values that were tweaked.
# FR : interface HDA du materiau, 8 parametres maximum par categorie, portes par le noeud reseau Copernicus ; chaque wrangle les lit avec chf() ; les valeurs modifiees survivent a une reconstruction.
